" Java keyword conceal
syntax keyword javaPublic    public    conceal cchar=○
syntax keyword javaPrivate   private   conceal cchar=●
syntax keyword javaProtected protected conceal cchar=◎
syntax keyword javaStatic    static    conceal cchar=⚙
syntax keyword javaReturn    return    conceal cchar=¶
syntax keyword javaVoid      void      conceal cchar=∅
syntax keyword javaNew       new       conceal cchar=ν
syntax keyword javaClass     class     conceal cchar=κ
syntax keyword javaFinal     final     conceal cchar=

syntax match javaPrint /System\.out\.println/ conceal cchar=🗩
